<title>UK: Kraftwerke sets 120 mln Swiss franc 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Kraftwerke sets 120 mln Swiss franc 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Zurcher Kantonalbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KRAFTWERKE LINTH-LIMMERN</p>
<p> AMT    120 MLN SFR   COUPON     4.00	MATURITY    05.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 PUBLIC    ISS PRICE  101.0     PAY DATE    05.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING    EBS	 DENOMS (K) FIVE	EOS	   06.FEB.97</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
